IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc-definitions`
IMPORT `roc4-order-19-div-1`
IMPORT `roc4-order-19-div-2`
IMPORT `roc4-order-19-div-3`

-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), Order 19, Division 3 (rules 24 to 40): TESTS.
-- Every expected value is written from the text beside the assertion, before the run, and is not copied from the encoding's output.
-- Time: made-up inputs stand for O 3 r 3's answer.  A last day of 10 February 2026 is used throughout unless the assertion says otherwise.

`o 19 test div 3 route GD to AD` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `General Division`, `Appellate Division`, FALSE, FALSE
`o 19 test div 3 route GD to CA` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `General Division`, `Court of Appeal`, FALSE, FALSE
`o 19 test div 3 route AD to CA` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `Appellate Division`, `Court of Appeal`, FALSE, FALSE
`o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to AD` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `General Division`, `Appellate Division`, TRUE, FALSE
`o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to CA` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `General Division`, `Court of Appeal`, TRUE, FALSE
`o 19 test div 3 route tribunal AD to CA` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `Appellate Division`, `Court of Appeal`, TRUE, FALSE
`o 19 test div 3 route DC to GD` MEANS `o 19 r 2 route of appeal` OF `District Court`, `General Division`, FALSE, FALSE

-- ===== Rule 24 =====
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(a) this Division applies to an appeal to the Appellate Division against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route GD to AD` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(a) this Division applies to an appeal to the Appellate Division against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route GD to CA` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(a) this Division applies to an appeal to the Appellate Division against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to AD` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(a) this Division applies to an appeal to the Appellate Division against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route DC to GD` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(b) this Division applies to an appeal to the Court of Appeal against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route GD to CA` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(b) this Division applies to an appeal to the Court of Appeal against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route GD to AD` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(b) this Division applies to an appeal to the Court of Appeal against a judgment of the General Division` `o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to CA` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(c) this Division applies to an appeal to the Court of Appeal against a judgment of the Appellate Division` `o 19 test div 3 route AD to CA` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(c) this Division applies to an appeal to the Court of Appeal against a judgment of the Appellate Division` `o 19 test div 3 route GD to CA` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(c) this Division applies to an appeal to the Court of Appeal against a judgment of the Appellate Division` `o 19 test div 3 route tribunal AD to CA` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(d) this Division applies to an application to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal relating to an appeal` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(d) this Division applies to an application to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal relating to an appeal` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(d) this Division applies to an application to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal relating to an appeal` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(e) this Division applies to an appeal from a tribunal to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal` `o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to AD` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(e) this Division applies to an appeal from a tribunal to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal` `o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to CA` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(e) this Division applies to an appeal from a tribunal to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal` `o 19 test div 3 route tribunal to AD` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 19 r 24(e) this Division applies to an appeal from a tribunal to the Appellate Division or the Court of Appeal` `o 19 test div 3 route GD to AD` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
