#ASSERT `o 19 r 26(2) the smaller of two counts` 5 3 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `o 19 r 26(2) the smaller of two counts` 4 4 EQUALS 4
-- 25 February 2026 is 9552 days after 1 January 2000 (26 years with 7 leap days = 9497, plus 55), and 9552 x 1440 = 13,754,880.
#ASSERT `o 19 r 26(2)(b) the start of the 15th day after the date the decision is made` (Date 10 2 2026) EQUALS 13754880
